{
  "id": "t11",
  "title": "IVA and GenAI",
  "short": "IVA",
  "blurb": "Studio regions, task keys, handoffs, and prompts that are production changes.",
  "group": "Intelligence",
  "level": "Advanced",
  "summary": "A bot is a task in the right region, with a way back to a named skill, and a prompt that was tested.",
  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "l01",
      "title": "Studio has regions",
      "level": "foundation",
      "minutes": 12,
      "objectives": [
        "Match Studio region to the domain",
        "Prefer DNS SRV over a pinned IP"
      ],
      "paragraphs": [
        "The technical requirements publish Studio portal hosts by region: five9.us, five9.au, five9.ca, five9.uk, and five9.br studioportal.io, plus older inferencecommunications.com names. A task built in the wrong region will not be the task your VCC domain can call.",
        "SIP notes in that same part of the PDF, including UDP 5060 and a beta TCP 5061, are labeled next to Studio SBC material. Do not paste those ports onto every VCC trunk without checking which SBC family the domain uses. DNS SRV is the preferred way to find Five9 SIP resources."
      ],
      "cites": [
        {
          "label": "Technical requirements PDF",
          "url": "https://documentation-be.five9.com/bundle/five9-technical-requirements/raw/resource/enus/five9-technical-requirements.pdf",
          "note": "Fetched for this lab in October 2026. Re-read before you buy hardware or open a firewall."
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": [
        "Studio signaling ports in the PDF are easy to misread as universal VCC trunk ports. Confirm which SBC your domain uses."
      ],
      "figure": {
        "kind": "stack",
        "title": "Studio portals in the PDF",
        "caption": "Pick the region that matches the domain.",
        "rows": [
          {
            "label": "US"
          },
          {
            "label": "Australia"
          },
          {
            "label": "Canada"
          },
          {
            "label": "UK"
          },
          {
            "label": "Brazil"
          }
        ]
      },
      "flow": {
        "title": "Open the right portal",
        "lanes": [
          "Admin",
          "Studio"
        ],
        "steps": [
          {
            "lane": "Admin",
            "title": "Region",
            "detail": "The VCC domain's region is known.",
            "frame": "region"
          },
          {
            "lane": "Studio",
            "title": "Host",
            "detail": "The matching studioportal host is opened.",
            "frame": "host"
          },
          {
            "lane": "Studio",
            "title": "Task",
            "detail": "The task is created there.",
            "frame": "task"
          },
          {
            "lane": "VCC",
            "title": "Point",
            "detail": "IVA Transfer or the digital key points at that task.",
            "frame": "point"
          },
          {
            "lane": "Net",
            "title": "SRV",
            "detail": "SIP targets prefer DNS SRV.",
            "frame": "srv"
