    {
      "id": "l02",
      "title": "A task key is not a vibe",
      "level": "practice",
      "minutes": 12,
      "objectives": [
        "Follow the digital key steps",
        "Keep voice steps in their own note"
      ],
      "paragraphs": [
        "IVA Transfer is a module. It needs a task to transfer to. The digital integration article, dated in the community as 26 March 2026, says you copy a ChatBot task key into the VCC IVA transfer side after the Studio task exists.",
        "Voice and digital write-ups are separate. Use the article that matches the channel. A key with no Build permission, in that digital article, is not enough: the key is created with Build selected."
      ],
      "cites": [
        {
          "label": "Studio digital IVA with VCC",
          "url": "https://community.five9.com/s/article/Studio-7-Integrate-Digital-IVA-in-Studio-with-VCC?language=en_US"
        },
        {
          "label": "IVR modules",
          "url": "https://documentation.five9.com/bundle/ivr-admin/page/ivr-admin/modules/_ch-modules.htm"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": [
        "Voice IVA Transfer property names are not copied key-for-key from the digital article."
      ],
