          "answer": 1,
          "why": "It says select Build."
        },
        {
          "q": "The task type in that article is",
          "choices": [
            "Predictive",
            "ChatBot",
            "Skill group",
            "Campaign profile"
          ],
          "answer": 1,
          "why": "Create ChatBot task."
        },
        {
          "q": "The task key goes",
          "choices": [
            "Into a disposition comment",
            "Into the VCC IVA transfer side",
            "Into the JRE",
            "Into MyE911"
          ],
          "answer": 1,
          "why": "The article says to paste it there."
        },
        {
          "q": "A voice IVA design can ignore that article. True or false?",
          "choices": [
            "Always true",
            "You need the voice write-up. Do not assume the ChatBot steps are the voice screen",
            "False, they are identical",
            "True if you paste"
          ],
          "answer": 1,
          "why": "Channel matters."
        },
        {
          "q": "IVA Transfer without a task",
          "choices": [
