          "answer": 1,
          "why": "Draw the return path."
        },
        {
          "q": "Default queue is what you get if",
          "choices": [
            "The skill is named",
            "Skill Transfer has no skill",
            "TLS 1.2 is on",
            "The schedule is right"
          ],
          "answer": 1,
          "why": "Select the skill."
        },
        {
          "q": "Context the agent sees is",
          "choices": [
            "Automatic from any variable",
